{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"じゃ、せーので押すぞ\r\n──せーの……","trans":"那，喊预备就按哦\n——预备……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"どっちが出たかな……？","trans":"会出来哪一边呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017310010","name":"霧子","text":"きっと……\r\nわたしが……押した方……","trans":"一定是……\n我……按的那一边……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017310011","name":"霧子＆プロデューサー","text":"──ミルクコーヒーだ……！","trans":"——是牛奶咖啡……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017310020","name":"霧子","text":"ふふっ……\r\nプレゼント……してくれたんですね……","trans":"呵呵……\n是你送我的礼物呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……えっ、いや\r\nえっと────！","trans":"……诶，不是\n那个————！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}